Package: tlt_custom_pkg_yachtsense-link-emulator
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Architecture: ipq40xx
Maintainer: Roel Broersma
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libc, api-core, vuci-ui-core
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: YachtSense Link discovery emulator for Teltonika RUTX routers on RutOS 7. Includes an ARMv7 mDNS and HTTP daemon, UCI configuration, procd integration and a VuCI management page.
